#: ../developer/glossary.md:1
msgid "Glossary"
msgstr "术语表"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:3
msgid ""
"The words these pages use for the parts of a gateway, in the order you "
"meet them. When a page uses one of these terms, it means exactly what is "
"written here."
msgstr "本文档用来称呼网关各个部分的术语，按阅读时遇到的先后排列。文档里用到这些术语时，含义就以这里写的为准。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:7
msgid "Requests and models"
msgstr "请求与模型"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:9
msgid "Model id"
msgstr "模型 id"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:10
msgid ""
"The name a client sends in the `model` field, such as `example-chat`. It "
"is the gateway's public name for a model and is independent of what any "
"provider calls it."
msgstr ""
"客户端在 `model` 字段里填的名字，例如 `example-chat`。它是网关对外公布的模型名，和任何 provider "
"自己怎么称呼这个模型无关。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:14
msgid "Alias"
msgstr "别名（alias）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:15
msgid ""
"Another name that resolves to the same model id. Declared with `aliases:`"
" on the model."
msgstr "解析到同一个模型 id 的另一个名字。在模型上用 `aliases:` 声明。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:18
msgid "Model registry"
msgstr "模型注册表（model registry）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:19
msgid ""
"The YAML file, usually `models.yaml`, that lists every model id and the "
"routes behind it. [Configuration](configuration.md) explains how the "
"gateway finds it."
msgstr ""
"一个 YAML 文件，通常叫 `models.yaml`，列出每个模型 id "
"以及它背后的路由。网关怎么找到这个文件，见[配置](configuration.md)。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:23
msgid "API key and provider key"
msgstr "API key 与 provider key"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:24
msgid ""
"An API key is what a client presents to the gateway. A provider key is "
"what the gateway presents to a provider. They are never the same "
"credential."
msgstr "API key 是客户端出示给网关的凭据；provider key 是网关出示给 provider 的凭据。两者永远不是同一个。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:27
msgid "Routes and providers"
msgstr "路由与 provider"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:29
msgid "Route"
msgstr "路由（route）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:30
msgid ""
"One way of serving a model id: an entry in the model's `route:` list that"
" names an adapter kind, a base URL, a credential and a weight. A model id"
" can have several routes, and that is what lets the gateway balance and "
"fail over between them."
msgstr ""
"为模型 id 提供服务的一条途径，也就是模型 `route:` 列表里的一项，写明 adapter 的 kind、base "
"URL、凭据和权重。一个模型 id 可以有多条路由，网关正是靠这一点在多条路由之间做负载均衡和故障切换。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:35
msgid "Endpoint"
msgstr "端点（endpoint）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:36
msgid ""
"The server a route sends requests to. Pages say \"endpoint\" when they "
"mean the server and \"route\" when they mean the configuration entry."
msgstr "路由发送请求的目标服务器。文档里说「端点」时指服务器本身，说「路由」时指配置里的那一项。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:39
msgid "`endpoint_id`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/glossary.md:40
msgid ""
"The gateway's key for one endpoint of one model, written `<model-"
"id>:<location>` — `glm-4.6:local-12003` for a server on local port 12003,"
" `glm-4.6:zai-api` for a hosted API. Circuit breakers, latency profiles "
"and weight overrides are all keyed on it. The suffix comes from the host "
"and port or from the adapter kind, so it does not tell you who runs the "
"server."
msgstr ""
"网关用来标识「某个模型的某个端点」的键，写作 `<model-id>:<location>`：本机 12003 端口上的服务器是 "
"`glm-4.6:local-12003`，托管 API 是 `glm-4.6:zai-"
"api`。熔断器、延迟统计和权重覆盖都以它为键。后缀来自主机和端口，或者来自 adapter 的 kind，所以从它看不出服务器是谁在运行。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:47
msgid "Provider"
msgstr "provider"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:48
msgid ""
"The service behind a route: OpenRouter, DeepSeek, your own vLLM server. "
"In configuration, a route's `provider:` is the label its traffic is "
"reported under in logs and dashboards."
msgstr ""
"路由背后的服务：OpenRouter、DeepSeek、你自己的 vLLM 服务器。在配置里，路由的 `provider:` "
"是一个标签，这条路由的流量在日志和仪表盘里都记在这个标签下。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:52
msgid "Kind"
msgstr "kind"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:53
msgid ""
"A route's `kind:`, which picks the adapter that talks to the endpoint: "
"`openai_compat`, `vllm`, `openrouter`, `anthropic` and so on."
msgstr ""
"路由的 `kind:`，决定用哪个 adapter "
"和端点通信：`openai_compat`、`vllm`、`openrouter`、`anthropic` 等。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:56
msgid "Adapter"
msgstr "adapter"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:57
msgid ""
"The code that speaks one provider's API. It builds the request, holds the"
" provider key and turns the response back into the OpenAI shape. Self-"
"hosted servers use the generic OpenAI-compatible adapter."
msgstr ""
"对接某一家 provider API 的代码。它负责构造请求、持有 provider key，并把响应转换回 OpenAI "
"的格式。自建服务器用的是通用的 OpenAI 兼容 adapter。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:61
msgid "Upstream"
msgstr "上游（upstream）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:62
msgid "Whatever the gateway calls to produce an answer — the far end of a route."
msgstr "网关为了得到回答而调用的那一端，也就是路由的另一头。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:64
msgid "Choosing a route"
msgstr "选择路由"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:66
msgid "Router"
msgstr "router"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:67
msgid ""
"The per-model logic that picks a route for each request. `fixed` draws a "
"route at random by weight and falls back to the others on failure; it is "
"the default. `routewise` trades latency against cost. A model chooses one"
" with `router:`."
msgstr ""
"按模型配置、为每个请求挑选路由的逻辑。`fixed` 按权重随机选一条路由，失败时回退到其他路由，是默认值；`routewise` "
"在延迟和成本之间做取舍。模型用 `router:` 指定其中一个。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:72
msgid "Weight"
msgstr "权重（weight）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:73
msgid ""
"A route's relative share of traffic under the `fixed` router. A route "
"with weight `0` stays configured but receives no traffic, not even as a "
"fallback."
msgstr "在 `fixed` router 下，一条路由分到的相对流量份额。权重为 `0` 的路由仍保留在配置里，但不会收到任何流量，连回退也不会用到它。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:76
msgid "Fallback"
msgstr "回退（fallback）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:77
msgid ""
"What the router does when a route fails: it tries the model's remaining "
"routes in order until one answers."
msgstr "某条路由失败时 router 的做法：按顺序尝试该模型剩下的路由，直到有一条返回结果。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:80
msgid "Circuit breaker"
msgstr "熔断器（circuit breaker）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:81
msgid ""
"A per-endpoint switch that stops sending traffic to an endpoint after "
"repeated failures and lets a single test request through after a "
"cooldown."
msgstr "按端点设置的开关：端点反复失败后，停止向它发送流量；冷却一段时间后，只放一个测试请求过去。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:84
msgid "Offload route"
msgstr "卸载路由（offload route）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:85
msgid ""
"A route set aside for the requests a model's other routes cannot start in"
" time. See [Queue-wait offload](routing.md#queue-wait-offload)."
msgstr "一条预留的路由，专门接收模型的其他路由来不及开始处理的请求。见[排队等待卸载](routing.md#queue-wait-offload)。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:88
msgid "Routing file"
msgstr "路由配置文件（routing file）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:89
msgid ""
"The optional `routing.yaml`. It holds health-probe settings and a "
"local/remote weight split; see [The routing file](configuration.md#the-"
"routing-file) for what it does and does not change."
msgstr ""
"可选的 "
"`routing.yaml`。里面是健康探测设置和本地/远程的权重划分；它能改变什么、不能改变什么，见[路由配置文件](configuration.md"
"#the-routing-file)。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:93
msgid "Deployments"
msgstr "部署"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:95
msgid "Distribution"
msgstr "发行版（distribution）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:96
msgid ""
"One deployment's own files — its manifest, model registry, routing file, "
"branding and Compose settings — kept together in `distributions/<name>/` "
"instead of in the source. `distributions/example/` is the one this "
"repository ships."
msgstr ""
"某个部署自己的文件——它的 manifest、模型注册表、路由配置文件、品牌和 Compose 设置——集中放在 "
"`distributions/<name>/` 里，而不是放在源码里。`distributions/example/` 是本仓库自带的那一个。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:101
msgid "Overlay"
msgstr "overlay"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:102
msgid ""
"The `distributions/<name>/` directory itself. It is called an overlay "
"because it is mounted over the neutral image rather than built into it."
msgstr "`distributions/<name>/` 这个目录本身。之所以叫 overlay，是因为它挂载在中立镜像之上，而不是打包进镜像。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:105
msgid "Manifest"
msgstr "manifest"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:106
msgid ""
"`distribution.yaml`, the file in a distribution that names it and says "
"where its configuration files are."
msgstr "`distribution.yaml`，发行版里的一个文件，写明发行版的名字以及各配置文件放在哪里。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:109
msgid "Dry run and active"
msgstr "试运行与生效（dry run / active）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:110
msgid ""
"The two modes of `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE`. In a dry run — the default, "
"written `dark` in the setting — the gateway reads and checks the manifest"
" and logs what it would change, but uses nothing from it. `active` "
"applies it."
msgstr ""
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE` 的两种模式。试运行是默认模式，这个设置里写作 `dark`：网关会读取并检查 "
"manifest，在日志里记下启用后会改变什么，但不使用其中任何内容。`active` 则真正应用它。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:115
msgid "Operational store"
msgstr "运行数据存储（operational store）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:116
msgid ""
"The Postgres tables that hold accounts, API keys and everything changed "
"from the admin console."
msgstr "Postgres 里存放账号、API key 以及管理控制台上所有改动的那些表。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:119
msgid "Runtime model"
msgstr "运行时模型（runtime model）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:120
msgid ""
"A model created from the admin console instead of the model registry. It "
"exists only in the operational store."
msgstr "在管理控制台里创建、而不是写在模型注册表里的模型。它只存在于运行数据存储中。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:123
msgid "Console"
msgstr "控制台（console）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:124
msgid ""
"The Next.js web app: sign-up and sign-in, the user dashboard, the "
"playground and the admin console. It also forwards API paths to the "
"gateway; see [The public path table](public-path-table.md)."
msgstr ""
"Next.js 网页应用：注册和登录、用户仪表盘、对话调试页（playground）和管理控制台。它还会把 API 路径转发给网关，见[公开路径表"
"](public-path-table.md)。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:128
msgid "Site UI module"
msgstr "Site UI 模块（Site UI module）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:129
msgid ""
"A distribution's own React components for the public pages, compiled into"
" its console image. See [Site UI Modules](site-ui-modules.md)."
msgstr "发行版为公开页面编写的 React 组件，编译进它自己的控制台镜像。见 [Site UI 模块](site-ui-modules.md)。"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:132
msgid "Backend extension"
msgstr "后端扩展（后端 extension）"

#: ../developer/glossary.md:133
msgid ""
"A trusted Python module a deployment loads at startup to add an adapter, "
"an agent-access rule or a quota source. See [Backend Extensions](backend-"
"extensions.md)."
msgstr ""
"部署在启动时加载的可信 Python 模块，用来添加 adapter、agent 访问规则或配额来源。见[后端扩展](backend-"
"extensions.md)。"
